OL,3,GNEWSAFormer grammar school could be
OL,4,Aturned into church
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former school could become a church
OL,7,Fand community hub.
OL,9,FPlans for the Hull Grammar School
OL,10,Fbuilding on Cottingham Road includes a
OL,11,Fplace of worship as well as offices,
OL,12,Fyouth clubs, a children's room, and
OL,13,Fspace for music classes and a food
OL,14,Fbank.
OL,16,FThe religious group or denomination
OL,17,Fbehind the proposals has not yet been
OL,18,Fnamed in public council documents.
OL,20,FPrevious plans to convert the building
OL,21,Finto student housing were rejected.
